# Occupancy

Narrative and code map: [docs/occupancy.md](../../docs/occupancy.md). Read it before changing this area.

## Must preserve

- Site stays **static**; enquiries **mailto-only**. Snapshot in `occupancy.json` — not a live booking check. No rates/quotes/booking API.
- Public houses only (`casa-1`…`casa-4`). Omit Casa #5 and Tutte. Map lives in `lodgify.ts`; API key never in git.
- Fail closed on sync errors; unchanged fingerprint → no commit. Strip guest/booking fields from public JSON.
- Occupied nights disabled in the calendar; checkout morning of an occupied night stays allowed (`[checkIn, checkOut)`).
- Tests use fixtures — never hit Lodgify. `assert-build` keeps mailto + four house snapshot keys.
